    "paragraph": "Three of today's papers carry the tag \"Traffic Prediction and Management Techniques,\" focusing on an IoT-based accident detection and prevention mechanism, the spatial and temporal mapping of noise levels at Varanasi traffic intersections, and evaluating the need for traffic signal retiming using connected vehicle data. Outside this group, another paper analyzes the governance of informal settlements in Jakarta through a comparative study of five neighborhoods. Additionally, a study examines the governance and socio-spatial dynamics of commodity-resettlement mixed communities in urbanizing China. Finally, researchers modeled the adoption potential of demand-responsive transport services in the UK using survey data from the Greater Leeds region.",
